					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12752681#post-4407988</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12752681/goc-or-that-guy-with-a-gun-fetish#post-4407988</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 27 Oct 2019 12:21:52 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>cybersqyd</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5336470</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I was really enjoying this right up until the ending which kinda, botched the landing for me :(</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;longer&nbsp;form&nbsp;thought&nbsp;on&nbsp;this</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;longer&nbsp;form&nbsp;thought</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p>&quot;I mean come on, Santa Claus? That's just ridiculous.&quot;</p> <p>The smile quickly slipped off of Ten's face. &quot;Wait, what?&quot;</p> </blockquote> <p>There's two ways of reading this: either they were only joking about Santa Claus and everything else is true; or they think that Ten should've realised at Santa Claus and everything else is false. Leaving it ambiguous like this feels, kinda unsatisfying to me and idk, I just, didn't appreciate it.</p> <p>I'd probably suggest ending it either after the &quot;Wow. Can't believe I actually fell for that.&quot; or the &quot;Thanks, it's good to be here&quot; if you want to change it (or being more explicit about how much was just a joke) but judging from the rating, it might just be me that objects here.</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
